---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Replication log positions of one leader and three followers. Entry numbers are illustrative.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 330" role="img" aria-label="The leader holds log entries 39 to 43. Follower 1 has applied all five, follower 2 has applied up to 42 and is one entry behind, follower 3 has applied up to 41 and is two entries behind.">
    <text x="300" y="24" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Replication log, newest entry on the right</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Replication log, entry mới nhất nằm bên phải</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={40} y={70} size={30} />
    <text x="70" y="75" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Leader</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Leader</tspan></text>
    <rect x="300" y="48" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="332" y="75" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#39</text>
    <rect x="372" y="48" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="404" y="75" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#40</text>
    <rect x="444" y="48" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="476" y="75" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#41</text>
    <rect x="516" y="48" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="548" y="75" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#42</text>
    <rect x="588" y="48" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="620" y="75" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#43</text>
    <text x="680" y="75" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>has every entry</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>có đủ mọi entry</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={40} y={142} size={30} />
    <text x="70" y="147" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Follower 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Follower 1</tspan></text>
    <rect x="300" y="120" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="332" y="147" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#39</text>
    <rect x="372" y="120" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="404" y="147" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#40</text>
    <rect x="444" y="120" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="476" y="147" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#41</text>
    <rect x="516" y="120" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="548" y="147" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#42</text>
    <rect x="588" y="120" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="620" y="147" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#43</text>
    <text x="680" y="147" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>up to date</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đã bắt kịp</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={40} y={214} size={30} />
    <text x="70" y="219" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Follower 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Follower 2</tspan></text>
    <rect x="300" y="192" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="332" y="219" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#39</text>
    <rect x="372" y="192" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="404" y="219" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#40</text>
    <rect x="444" y="192" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="476" y="219" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#41</text>
    <rect x="516" y="192" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="548" y="219" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#42</text>
    <rect x="588" y="192" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box empty" />
    <text x="620" y="219" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#43</text>
    <text x="680" y="219" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>1 entry behind</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chậm 1 entry</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={40} y={286} size={30} />
    <text x="70" y="291" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Follower 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Follower 3</tspan></text>
    <rect x="300" y="264" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="332" y="291" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#39</text>
    <rect x="372" y="264" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="404" y="291" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#40</text>
    <rect x="444" y="264" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="476" y="291" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#41</text>
    <rect x="516" y="264" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box empty" />
    <text x="548" y="291" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#42</text>
    <rect x="588" y="264" width="64" height="44" rx="4" class="box empty" />
    <text x="620" y="291" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#43</text>
    <text x="680" y="291" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>2 entries behind</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chậm 2 entry</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A follower is a position in the leader's log. Follower 3 has not applied #42 and #43 yet, so a read from it misses the two latest writes.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mỗi follower chỉ là một vị trí trong log của leader. Follower 3 chưa áp dụng #42 và #43, nên đọc từ nó sẽ thiếu hai lần ghi mới nhất.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
